ject-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#rules-we-follow-summary","content":"Functions/vars `lower_snake_case`; `name()` without `function` keyword"},"1301":{"id":"/prompting","page_id":"/prompting","type":"page","content":"Prompting every US-safe model","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting"},"1302":{"id":"/prompting-0","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting","content":"Model-native prompt recipes and lazy Prompt Enhance nodes for Klein, Wan, LTX, and opt-in families."},"1303":{"id":"/prompting-1","page_id":"/prompting","type":"heading","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Prompting every US-safe model"},"1304":{"id":"/prompting-2","page_id":"/prompting","type":"heading","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Models and text encoders"},"1305":{"id":"/prompting-3","page_id":"/prompting","type":"heading","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting#recipes","content":"Recipes"},"1306":{"id":"/prompting-4","page_id":"/prompting","type":"heading","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting#prompt-enhance-nodes","content":"Prompt Enhance nodes"},"1307":{"id":"/prompting-5","page_id":"/prompting","type":"heading","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"url":"/prompting#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"1308":{"id":"/prompting-6","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"**What's on this page**"},"1309":{"id":"/prompting-7","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"How each US-safe model actually reads a prompt (defaults and opt-in)"},"1310":{"id":"/prompting-8","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Canned lab graph text (already rewritten)"},"1311":{"id":"/prompting-9","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"GIF loop motion and dream-house world bible (one place prompt; walkthrough shot cards per room — lens, height, a distinct room program, near/far; Prompt Join lock=view). Clay tour: same bible, Klein restyles Blender stills"},"1312":{"id":"/prompting-10","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Character draft then tweak (style dropdown; generated still as the next reference)"},"1313":{"id":"/prompting-11","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Lazy path: Prompt Enhance nodes (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). Seeded graphs pin Enhance **on** for lazy CLIP printers and **off** when the string is already a recipe, script, or film shot."},"1314":{"id":"/prompting-12","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Negative CLIP nodes go through **Negative Prompt Enhance** (positive CLIP string as context) so canned `illustration` / `Pixar` terms cannot fight the intended look. Families: klein, wan, ltx, zimage, longcat, dreamx, s2v. Distilled CFG 1 models still get a list; fold real exclusions into the **positive**."},"1315":{"id":"/prompting-13","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Rewriter **context** sockets carry a bible, logline, research brief, or episode script. Enhance **off** ignores context so authored recipes stay pinned"},"1316":{"id":"/prompting-14","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Style dropdown: research-backed look references; dropdown wins over style already in the source"},"1317":{"id":"/prompting-15","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Sample prompt dropdown: 20 lab recipes for **this graph** plus **Custom** to type your own. Default is Custom so the canned widget text still Queues. Pick a sample to fill (and lock) the Prompt box; pick Custom to edit. **stills/dream-house** lists place recipes (Cliff villa, Forest cabin, …), not Klein still or Wan motion recipes. Queue still accepts a stamped label from another catalog so specialized graphs do not fail validation."},"1318":{"id":"/prompting-16","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"After Queue, the dim **CLIP prompt** box is always visible and shows the string CLIP/ACE encoded"},"1319":{"id":"/prompting-17","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"**What this enables**"},"1320":{"id":"/prompting-18","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Writing (or pasting) a prompt that matches the encoder in front of you instead of SD1.5 tag soup"},"1321":{"id":"/prompting-19","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Picking a lab sample prompt from the App dropdown, or Custom to type a lazy sentence the on-box Qwen3 rewriter expands for Klein / Wan / LTX / Z-Image / LongCat / DreamX"},"1322":{"id":"/prompting-20","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Optional style dropdown (150 presets): the rewriter weaves research-backed medium, light, color, and texture into the CLIP prompt, and retunes any style already in the source"},"1323":{"id":"/prompting-21","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"**Cinema Rack** (`inspire/cinema-rack`): pick one cinematography technique per axis (shot size, angle, move, lens, light, …) and splice a Klein / Wan / LTX string. Deterministic — no LLM. Wan emits one camera verb. Lazy Prompt Enhance uses the same catalog language (clauses, recipes, Wan tokens) when it rewrites. Cinema Rack"},"1324":{"id":"/prompting-22","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"**Audio Rack** (`inspire/audio-rack`): pick one audio/music technique per axis (genre, tempo, drums, bass, vocal, form, …) and splice ACE-Step tags plus lyrics form. Deterministic — no LLM. Vocal identity is omitted on instrumental and podcast-bed. ACE Prompt Enhance uses the same catalog language when it rewrites. Audio Rack"},"1325":{"id":"/prompting-23","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Seeded lab graphs use research-backed Positive / Motion text. Prompt Enhance is **on** for lazy CLIP printers (Klein stills, generic 5s Wan/LTX, identity bibles you type). It is **off** for authored recipes: 90s films, talking-head freeze, ping-pong loops, camera-verb I2V, podcast Speaker A/B scripts, ACE tags/lyrics, IC-LoRA. Turn it the other way in the App if you want. **inspire/app-forge** clones a shipped lab graph into live `_user/` from a brief (occupancy **llm**; does not Queue). **inspire/research-chat** is a no-UNET creative desk (occupancy **llm**): chat or planner+search subagents, then paste ingredients into **inspire/prompt-forge** Context (or type the lazy sentence once in Prompt — all three families share it). Beat Sheet packs Logline / Script / Audio policy / Score into every card rewrite. 90s films wire the Klein identity STRING into each LTX enhance **context** (dormant while Enhance is off). The CLIP prompt box is visible before Queue (empty until rewrite) and shows the encoded string after."},"1326":{"id":"/prompting-24","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#prompting-every-us-safe-model","content":"Why the three models exist: Klein, Wan, and LTX."},"1327":{"id":"/prompting-25","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Model"},"1328":{"id":"/prompting-26","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Encoder"},"1329":{"id":"/prompting-27","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"CLIP type"},"1330":{"id":"/prompting-28","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Prompt shape"},"1331":{"id":"/prompting-29","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Negative"},"1332":{"id":"/prompting-30","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"FLUX.2 Klein 4B distilled / NVFP4"},"1333":{"id":"/prompting-31","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Qwen3-4B"},"1334":{"id":"/prompting-32","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"`flux2`"},"1335":{"id":"/prompting-33","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"Sentences. Subject → shot size → angle → lens → light (Cinema Rack). Under \\~150 words. Positive opposites, not “no logos”."},"1336":{"id":"/prompting-34","page_id":"/prompting","tags":["prompting","klein","wan","ltx","zimage","longcat","dreamx","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/prompting#models-and-text-encoders","content":"CFG 1.0 — ignored unless you raise CFG or swap **base**"},"1337":{"id":"/prompting-35"