gle-shot iterate: **motion/av/still-to-shot**.\nShot-level resume lives under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/films/<slug>/` (`state.json`, `shots/NN.mp4`). A dropped SSH session is not a two-hour requeue:"},"1500":{"id":"/shorts-86","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Host / spark-farm fallback (when you printed shots outside the one-click graph):"},"1501":{"id":"/shorts-87","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Optional jobstore board (no GPU, 512m, `restart: \"no\"`). Default `start` does **not** launch it:"},"1502":{"id":"/shorts-88","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"LTX Director is a **GPL** clone into the Comfy volume, not this MIT tree:"},"1503":{"id":"/shorts-89","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Refuse MiniMax H3 Director. OpenCut (`jtydhr88/ComfyUI-OpenCut`, MIT) is fail-soft. Not the OpenCut Rust rewrite, not Next.js+Postgres."},"1504":{"id":"/spark-farm","page_id":"/spark-farm","type":"page","content":"Spark farm","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"url":"/spark-farm"},"1505":{"id":"/spark-farm-0","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm","content":"Three DGX Sparks as independent Comfy workers plus a shared model cache — no NCCL, no MiniMax H3."},"1506":{"id":"/spark-farm-1","page_id":"/spark-farm","type":"heading","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"url":"/spark-farm#spark-farm","content":"Spark farm"},"1507":{"id":"/spark-farm-2","page_id":"/spark-farm","type":"heading","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"Runbook (numbered)"},"15