content":"**Handoff (start in App Mode):** load **stills/still-draft** → enter App Mode → Queue Spark Still → open **stills/still-hero** (same seed) → set **motion/silent/still-to-video-5s** LoadImage to `ez_still_draft_*.png` or `ez_still_hero_*.png` → Queue \\~5 s silent → optional **motion/av/still-to-video-12s** for native audio. Showcase: **motion/av/dialogue-12s** (quoted speech), **motion/av/multishot-12s** (named cuts), **motion/av/product-hero** (packshot), **motion/av/first-last-12s** (two stills), **motion/av/audio-to-video-12s** (freeze a wav). Platform jobs (channel art, 4:5 feed, Canvas, BRB): Creator pack — same occupancy XOR, e.g. **creator/stills/youtube-shorts-thumb** → **creator/silent/zoom-punch**. Stop Wan before LTX (occupancy). I2V graphs also Queue on Comfy’s default **example.png**. Apps catalog: ComfyUI Apps."},"1877":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-41","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#combined-pipeline-klein--wan--ltx","content":"LTX-2.5 is a **joint audio/video** transformer. Seeded LTX graphs load the **audio VAE**, create matching empty audio latents, concat them with video latents before `KSampler&#x60;, then decode audio with &#x2A;*`LTXVAudioVAEDecode`*&#x2A; into &#x2A;*`VHS_VideoCombine`** so the MP4 includes world audio. Text conditioning is a single **CLIPLoader** (`gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot&#x60;, type &#x2A;*`ltxv`**)."},"1878":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-42","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"License-clean AV path for a company under the LTX Community License revenue cap. Quality combo &#x2A;*Free Commercial Use (\\<$10M)** on Klein and LTX Apps. Do not put Klein 9B or FLUX.2-dev on this path (those are FLUX Non-Commercial)."},"1879":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-43","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"**Still** — Klein **4B** at clip size. Landscape **1280×704**. Portrait **768×1280**. Pick a seed on **Draft** (4-step), then Queue this quality at the **same** pixels. Generic 16:9 / 9:16 Format rows retarget to those feeders; named platform jobs stay put."},"1880":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-44","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"**Optional polish** — SeedVR2 on that PNG (`download-restore --tier seedvr2-3b`). Add detail at \\~1.3–1.5×. Do not jump to 4K. Stop Comfy first."},"1881":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-45","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"**Motion** — same PNG into **motion/av/still-to-video-12s** (LTX-2.5 I2V). Prompt only the motion and sound. Let LTX’s own 2× upscaler / DFR Templates handle resolution."},"1882":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-46","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"**Unload Klein before LTX.** Occupancy chip; one GB10 job. 90s films already pass the identity still through **Unload models**."},"1883":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-47","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Wan silent 5 s stays the Apache rehearsal path (no $10M cap, no native audio). This quality is a no-op on Wan / audio / trellis Apps."},"1884":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-48","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Download the default pack first (`download-models` = image fast + wan 5b + ltx 2.5)"},"1885":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-49","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Prefer keeping both model sets loaded between T2I and I2V"},"1886":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-50","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Do not GPU-offload a 30B+ llama.cpp next to LTX; Prompt Enhance is CPU-only (\\~2.5 GiB GGUF)"},"1887":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-51","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Video graphs emit **MP4** via **VideoHelperSuite** (`VHS_VideoCombine`, 24 fps) plus optional PNG frames"},"1888":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-52","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Prompting: Klein wants Qwen-style prose (subject → light → camera); Wan wants motion + one camera move (no audio); LTX wants a present-tense paragraph with sound interleaved. See Prompting. Every seeded lab canvas has an operator **Note**"},"1889":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-53","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#free-commercial-use-10m","content":"Which filename: Workflow catalog."},"1890":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-54","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Do **not** edit raw JSON. Change widgets on the canvas."},"1891":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-55","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Load **stills/still-draft** → set Positive prompt + seed (fixed) → Queue (minutes, 4-step)."},"1892":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-56","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Pick a frame under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (`ez_still_draft_*.png`)."},"1893":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-57","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Load **motion/silent/still-to-video-5s** → set LoadImage to that PNG (or leave `example.png` to smoke-test) → edit **Motion / prompt** only → Queue \\~5 s silent."},"1894":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-58","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Optional audio: **motion/av/still-to-video-12s**, same first frame, same seed note, Queue \\~5 s AV at **1280×704**."},"1895":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-59","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Short six-shot demo: Queue **motion/silent/still-to-shot** six times (`ez_shot_01` … `06`) then:"},"1896":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-60","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"**90s films** (go-see first-person parkour / still-here / switchyard): load one **film-\\*-90s** graph → Queue **once** → the MP4 is already at `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/ez_<slug>_90s.mp4` (faststart). A **90s film ready** overlay plays and downloads it; `ez_<slug>_90s.html` is a local player. See 90s shorts."},"1897":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-61","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Daily still / GIF / IG pack: **stills/image-studio** (100 creator modes + Format / platform + optional reference) or **stills/still-studio** (Format / platform + Style + Rewrite prompt) or **stills/still-daily** → optional **motion/loops/gif-loop** (LoadImage = the still prefix you just saved, leave ping-pong on) or **stills/dream-house** for a 10-photo virtual tour of one place (type any place; each still a different room or view — tower, foyer, lounge, kitchen, dining, bedroom, bath, terrace, drone, study). Same walkthrough with 3D persistence: **stills/dream-house-clay** (`start` seeds clay plates; optional `house-views` dump) (Dream-house tours). Character loop: **stills/character-draft** → **stills/character-tweak** (`ez_character_*.png`). Lettering swap: **stills/text-swap** (output matches the source still)."},"1898":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-62","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Creator toolkit: vertical Shorts still→I2V, thumbnail, packshot, before/after, style lock, bumper, B-roll, storyboard 6-up — catalog."},"1899":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-63","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#iteration-loop-youtube-169","content":"Do not Queue a 90s denoise. Default graphs iterate in minutes; one-click films are 18 × 5s prints."},"1900":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-64","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"Seeded &#x2A;*wan-**\\* and &#x2A;*ltx-**\\* graphs install **ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite*&#x2A; and wire &#x2A;*`VHS_VideoCombine`** after video `VAEDecode` (`save_output: true&#x60;). LTX graphs also run &#x2A;*`LTXVAudioVAEDecode`** into the VHS **audio** input so world audio is muxed into the MP4. After **Queue**, open **Save video (MP4) — open node for preview** for an **inline preview**. PNG &#x2A;*Save frames (secondary)** is optional. Files are on the **host** at `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (container `/outputs`). `cleanup` does **not** delete this folder."},"1901":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-65","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"Graph"},"1902":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-66","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"Frames"},"1903":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-67","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"FPS"},"1904":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-68","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"≈ duration"},"1905":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-69","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"`wan-i2v-5s` / `wan-t2v-5s`"},"1906":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-70","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"121"},"1907":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-71","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","ltx","visual"],"type":"text","url":"/visual-generative-ai#watch-the-video-wan--ltx","content":"24"},"1908":{"id":"/visual-generative-ai-72","page_id":"/visual-generative-ai","tags":["comfyui","klein","wan","lt