ooks. Human rewrite required before any release."},"2561":{"id":"/create/music-rap-53","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#180s-nill-bye-diss-examples","content":"Style and trap/EDM packs keep the same dry-booth voice (`male rap vocals, dry booth, no autotune`). Trap/EDM graphs are rap **over** club beds — not autotune EDM vocals. Voices, tags, BPM, and seeds stay as shipped; only the bars change per take."},"2562":{"id":"/create/music-rap-54","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#180s-nill-bye-diss-examples","content":"A new album lands in `_lab/audio/albums/<artist>/<album-slug>/` with numbered tracks plus `cover.json` and `album.json`. Do not leave new graphs at the artist folder root."},"2563":{"id":"/create/music-rap-55","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#peer-review-audioalbumsnill-byepeer-review","content":"Lab catalog. Queue a track on its own. Full album: `./scripts/manage.sh album-render --album nill-bye/peer-review`."},"2564":{"id":"/create/music-rap-56","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#peer-review-audioalbumsnill-byepeer-review","content":"Graph"},"2565":{"id":"/create/music-rap-57","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#peer-review-audioalbumsnill-byepeer-review","content":"Tags / bpm"},"2566":{"id":"/create/music-rap-58","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-rap#peer-review-audioalbumsnill-byepeer-review","content":"Prefix"},"2567":{"id":"/create/music-rap-59","page_id":"/create/music-rap","tags":["music","rap","ace-step","nill-bye","us-safe