","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Apache 2.0"},"3624":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-24","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"**Wan 2.2** TI2V-5B"},"3625":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-25","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Silent T2V / I2V \\~5 s"},"3626":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-26","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"UMT5-XXL · `wan`"},"3627":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-27","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Apache 2.0 — **no native audio**"},"3628":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-28","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"**LTX-2.5** distilled INT8-convrot"},"3629":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-29","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Joint AV \\~12 s Apps (5 s film printers)"},"3630":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-30","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Gemma4-with-proj · `ltxv`"},"3631":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-31","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Community License, **gated**, $10M company cap"},"3632":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-32","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"Klein 9B and FLUX.2-dev are opt-in FLUX Non-Commercial packs, not defaults. MiniMax H3 is banned (US Excluded Territory). Canonical table: Model licenses."},"3633":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-33","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"**Handoff:** Queue a Klein still → set Wan **LoadImage** to that PNG → optional LTX I2V from the **same** first frame at **1280×704** (portrait **768×1280**)."},"3634":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-34","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#three-jobs-three-licenses","content":"**Free Commercial Use (\\<$10M):** Klein 4B at that clip size (Draft to pick a seed, then the commercial quality for the hero) → optional SeedVR2 polish on the PNG (not 4K) → LTX-2.5 I2V, motion + sound only. Unload Klein before LTX. Quality combo never selects Klein 9B or FLUX.2-dev on this path. Wan is the Apache silent rehearsal, not this LTX cap path."},"3635":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-35","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#what-you-type-vs-what-they-hear","content":"Sentences. Subject → place → light → camera. Under \\~150 words. Positive opposites, not “no logos”. Distilled = CFG 1.0 / 4 steps, so the Positive widget *is* the quality knob."},"3636":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-36","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#what-you-type-vs-what-they-hear","content":"The PNG owns look. Prompt **motion + one camera verb** (`dolly in`, `pan`, `tracking`, `fixed camera`). Silent — do not prompt a score, foley, or dialogue."},"3637":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-37","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#what-you-type-vs-what-they-hear","content":"Entity + scene + motion + aesthetic + one camera move, about 80–120 words. Still no audio."},"3638":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-38","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#what-you-type-vs-what-they-hear","content":"One flowing **present-tense** paragraph, 4–8 sentences, **sound interleaved** (wind beside the coat, not a trailer at the end). Dialogue in `\"quotes\"` only if you asked for speech. Shorts: world SFX, no score."},"3639":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-39","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#what-you-type-vs-what-they-hear","content":"Seeded lab graphs already ship model-native text. Leave **Enhance** off unless you replace that text with something short. Recipes: Prompting."},"3640":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-40","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#why-not-one-model-for-everything","content":"**Wan** is the legally cleanest motion default (Apache) and the cheap 5 s rehearsal. It cannot mux world audio."},"3641":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-41","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#why-not-one-model-for-everything","content":"**LTX** is the AV hero and is **not** Apache. You accept a gated license and a revenue cap for that audio."},"3642":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-42","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#why-not-one-model-for-everything","content":"**Klein** is the identity lock. A 90s film is Klein identity + 18 LTX prints, not a 90s Wan denoise."},"3643":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-43","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#why-not-one-model-for-everything","content":"Optional fallbacks (Z-Image, Wan A14B, LTX-2.3) live on Models and cache. They are not the first download."},"3644":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-44","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#occupancy","content":"Do **not** load Klein + Wan + LTX + ACE-Step in one session. Cover art is a separate Klein graph. Podcast and rap packs are opt-in and share the ACE-Step AIO file."},"3645":{"id":"/learn/pipeline-45","page_id":"/learn/pipeline","tags":["learn","klein","wan","ltx","pipeline","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/pipeline#occupancy","content":"Playbook after this page: Still to motion to AV. Which filename to load: Workflow catalog."},"3646":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","type":"page","content":"Backup and restore","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Operate"],"tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"url":"/operate/backup-restore"},"3647":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-0","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore","content":"What to back up (MODELS_DIR, comfy-state, COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR, occupancy JSON) and what not to treat as a secret dump. Restore order."},"3648":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-1","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","type":"heading","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"Backup and restore"},"3649":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-2","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","type":"heading","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"What to back up"},"3650":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-3","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","type":"