ing now sudo-heals each layout dir (same heal on `setup` / `start`). Last resort: `sudo chown -R \"$USER:$USER\" \"${MODELS_DIR}/comfy\"`"},"4202":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-34","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`mkdir: …/comfy-user/…/_rescued: Permission denied` during `start`"},"4203":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-35","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Nested `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/comfy-user` (or `_user`) is root-owned from the container bind while the output **root** is writable. `start` needs `_user/_rescued` for lab-graph rescue."},"4204":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-36","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Re-run `./scripts/manage.sh start` (type **yes**) — `start` / `setup` sudo-heal each output layout dir (not recursive over PNG/MP4). Last resort: `sudo chown \"$USER:$USER\"` those layout dirs. Do not `sudo ./scripts/manage.sh start`"},"4205":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-37","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`ln: … comfy/llm/….gguf: Permission denied` then `GGUF ready`"},"4206":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-38","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Relink into a nested dir the user cannot write; the GGUF is already present"},"4207":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-39","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Start is OK — Enhance works if that path exists. Heal: `./scripts/manage.sh download-models` **or** `setup` / `start` (sudo-chown `comfy/`). Do not abort start"},"4208":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-40","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Pending / can't start container"},"4209":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-41","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Docker/GPU runtime"},"4210":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-42","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`nvidia-smi`, Container Toolkit install"},"4211":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-43","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"`failed to fetch oauth token: denied` / `nvcr.io` Access Denied on `start`"},"4212":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-44","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"NGC base image pull without login"},"4213":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-45","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Pull latest (default bases are **Docker Hub** `nvidia/cuda` **runtime** for builder and final). Rebuild: `./scripts/manage.sh start`. If you set `CUDA_BASE_IMAGE` / `CUDA_RUNTIME_IMAGE` to `nvcr.io/...`, run `docker login nvcr.io` (user `$oauthtoken`, password = NGC API key)"},"4214":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-46","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Spark farm SSH / rsync over the wrong NIC"},"4215":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-47","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Using management hostnames for weights, or expecting remote compose"},"4216":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-48","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#host--docker","content":"Source `config/spark-farm.example.env` (`SPARK_HOSTS` + `${SPARK_USER}` for SSH; `SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` for NFS/rsync). Never rsync weights over the management NIC. `./scripts/utilities/spark-farm.sh` **never** remote `compose up` — run `./scripts/manage.sh start` locally on each node (type **yes**). Spark farm"},"4217":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-49","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#docker-missing-on-dgx-spark","content":"Docker is usually pre-installed on DGX Spark, but updates or OS reimages can remove it. Prefer **apt Docker CE** (not snap) so the NVIDIA Container Toolkit can attach GPUs."},"4218":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-50","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"Default cache is `/mnt/models` (shared with nvidia-dgx-spark-lab). Prefer bootstrap:"},"4219":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-51","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"`download-models` and `start` also sudo-heal nested `comfy/` (HF snapshots at the top level can be writable while `comfy/` is still root-owned). Do not prefix those commands with `sudo`."},"4220":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-52","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#models_dir-permission-denied","content":"Manual last resort:"},"4221":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-53","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#comfy_output_dir-nested-permission-denied","content":"Default media tree is `/mnt/comfy-output`. The root can be writable while `comfy-user/default/workflows/_user` is still root-owned (Comfy runs as root on the bind). `start` creates `_user/_rescued` on the host before compose up."},"4222":{"id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker-54","page_id":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker","tags":["troubleshooting","docker","models-dir","spark-farm"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/troubleshooting-host-docker#comfy_output_dir-nested-permission-denied","content":"Prefer bootstrap or a second `start` after pulling this heal:"},"4223":{"id":"/operate/troubleshoot